# configure-effects: crash-reproduction path -
# Configure > Effect volume > Enter > Esc (deterministic). Exercises the Effect-volume popup
# (showAdjustOptions) that used to smash the stack (fixed in 715098c).
#
# enter/enter/esc: reach the main menu (see menu.keys for why).
# down/enter: Multiplayer Race is disabled, so one Down from the default
#   "Start Racing" selection lands on "Configure" (skip-disabled behaviour,
#   verified in the original trial); Enter opens it.
# down/enter: Configure's items are Music Volume / Effect Volume / Define
#   Keyboard / Define Gamepad-Joystick / Gamepad-Joystick Disabled /
#   Previous menu - one Down from the default "Music Volume" lands on
#   "Effect Volume"; Enter opens the popup.
# wait, enter, esc: the exact repro - sit on the popup, confirm, leave
#   Configure back to the main menu.
#
# Verified with screenshots: reaches "ADJUST EFFECT VOLUME: NN%", then
# returns to the main menu with Configure highlighted, no crash (the bug
# is fixed on this tree).
enter w2000
enter w1800
esc w1200
down w800
enter w1500
down w800
enter w1500
w3000
enter w1500
esc w1200
